      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd agree, but only because of an existing VRChat bug...\nCurrently, many worlds rely on players having a certain volume setting. 75% or 80%, for example. Without UI percentage numbers those values are difficult to set.\nHowever... all VRChat audio sliders are bugged. Setting any slider to 75% actually sets it to 50% volume. 50% is actually 25%. 0% is 6.25% 🤦‍♂️\nThe UI designers were probably not aware of this bug, and decided not to include percentage numbers. If the volume bug was fixed then the UI would be OK as it is :)\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/audio-controls-reduce-volume-2x-more-quickly-than-they-should",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
